OL,3,GNEWSASearch for new rural bus service
OL,4,Aoperator goes on
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe search for a new operator to bring
OL,7,Fback a community bus service would
OL,8,Frequire further work, a council said.
OL,10,FThe Ability Bus service, based in
OL,11,FTowcester, Northamptonshire, ceased
OL,12,Foperating due to financial pressures in
OL,13,FApril, impacting elderly and vulnerable
OL,14,Fpeople who relied on it for daily
OL,15,Ftravel.
OL,17,FWest Northamptonshire Council announced
OL,18,Fa #172,000 community transport grant
OL,19,Ffund and said there had been
OL,20,F"significant interest" from groups
OL,21,Fwanting to provide replacement
OL,22,Fservices.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,367,360,200,160,0,100
